<title>POLAND: Zasada Q1 net rises to PLN 0.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Zasada Q1 net rises to PLN 0.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zasada preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 4.73 vs	4.80</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   3.10 vs	1.84</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.56 vs	0.52</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Sobieslaw Zasada Centrum SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				124.25 vs    100.70</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 122.63 vs     95.90</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 2.54 vs	1.32</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.30 vs	0.26</p>
<p>    financial costs			  1.93 vs	3.22</p>
<p>    investment				 2.22 vs     10.86</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
